 paths too tightly; keep speculative training simple or the proof search space can explode before functional bugs are exposed.","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"cores/bench/LESSONS.md","time":{"start":1778892211301,"end":1778892211349}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_070e7be15d448af1016a07bdb327448198b092c7d8e3ee6821"}},"id":"prt_e2e3d0455001X2bQpUkvRlEfFp","sessionID":"ses_1d1c30f35ffeFSlD80VslwT7Z9","messageID":"msg_e2e3cf2f1001I0intTneUrJve1"}}
