ription\": \"Precompute branch targets during decode and store them in the pipeline register.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Consume the latched branch target and remove the EX-side branch-target adder.\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 296.38, \"delta_pct\": 4.79, \"vs_baseline\": 4.79, \"fmax_mhz\": 133.12, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterat... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"id\": \"hyp-20260515-003-r1s2\", \"title\": \"Tiny BTB loop predictor\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"CoreMark spends a lot of time in short loops and repeated call/return\\npaths, so this core is paying the full EX-stage branch penalty on the\\nsame control transfers over and over. A very small predictor should\\nremove those bubbles with limited area cost and without changing the\\nin-order retirement contract.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"CoreMark spends a lot of time in short loops and repeated call/return\\npaths, so this core is paying the full EX-stage branch penalty on the\\nsame control transfers over and over. A very small predictor should\\nremove those bubbles with limited area cost and without changing the\\nin-order retirement contract.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a compact direct-mapped branch target buffer with 2-bit saturating\\ncounters and use it to speculatively redirect fetch on hot taken\\nbranches and jump targets from IF. Keep EX-stage resolution as the\\narchitectural source of truth so mispredict recovery stays simple and\\nthe RVFI / trap behavior remains unchanged.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Thread speculative next-PC selection through fetch and fall back to the existing redirect path on mispredicts.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Instantiate and connect the predictor update path using EX-stage resolution signals.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a small direct-mapped BTB with 2-bit counters and update logic for taken branches and jumps.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Thread speculative next-PC selection through fetch and fall back to the existing redirect path on mispredicts.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Instantiate and connect the predictor update path using EX-stage resolution signals.\"}, {\"fi... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl","time":{"start":1778892246846,"end":1778892246895}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0942373710f4b59c016a07bdd6b214819bb9267006c859a418"}},"id":"prt_e2e3d8f3c0015VbFg2tl8bQshG","sessionID":"ses_1d1c30f89ffep6lZOdnnvoKGwJ","messageID":"msg_e2e3d19e9001Fth0V6oKvkmz1t"}}
