{"type":"text","timestamp":1778929922243,"sessionID":"ses_1cf8402bdffejHwQXRomOTdHi7","part":{"id":"prt_e307c708a001RAGzF08bwcUrjV","messageID":"msg_e307c1e2e0016GiVpliSPLIoqe","sessionID":"ses_1cf8402bdffejHwQXRomOTdHi7","type":"text","text":"I found the repeated failure pattern: broad decode-bundle expansions and speculative control changes tend to regress, while narrow hot-path cleanup has been the only reliable win. I’m writing a smaller hypothesis focused on pruning always-on hazard compares with exact source-operand-use metadata.","time":{"start":1778929922186,"end":1778929922227},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0cd25bba46745c60016a0851020090819990768b81dc6e080a","phase":"commentary"}}}}
