{"type":"text","timestamp":1778902649524,"sessionID":"ses_1d124973effeGrfh0mwh4VjSua","part":{"id":"prt_e2edc4aa6001m80UheGwnFd2fs","messageID":"msg_e2edb9b0f00141B5OyMugvlKko","sessionID":"ses_1d124973effeGrfh0mwh4VjSua","type":"text","text":"I’ve got the angle: a single hot-path cleanup in the register file rather than another branch/control experiment. I’m writing the hypothesis YAML now.","time":{"start":1778902649510,"end":1778902649518},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0ad78eb7b1bfc1e3016a07e679588081999457796eff893d40","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778902650312,"sessionID":"ses_1d124973effeGrfh0mwh4VjSua","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_4hj4uuQh9wV1Jjf56uV2fXfC","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260516-001-r5s0.yaml\n+id: hyp-20260516-001-r5s0\n+title: \"Remove regfile write-first bypass\"\n+category: micro_opt\n+motivation: |\n+  The regfile currently spends combinational logic on same-cycle write-first\n+  bypassing for both read ports. That path is redundant with the existing\n+  EX-stage forwarding network, and it sits on every decode-cycle operand read.\n+  Simplifying it should trim a small but always-active hot path without\n+  changing architectural behavior.\n+hypothesis: |\n+  Remove the write-first bypass muxes from `reg_file.sv` and rely on the\n+  existing pipeline forwarding to supply younger values when an instruction\n+  reaches EX. The ID stage still reads the register array combinationally, but\n+  same-cycle WB-to-ID visibility is no longer implemented inside the regfile,\n+  which should reduce read-port fanout and improve Fmax.\n+expected_impact:\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 3\n+  confidence: medium\n+changes:\n+  - file: rtl/reg_file.sv\n+    description: \"Drop the same-cycle write-first read bypass so the read ports become simple array reads with only x0 special-casing.\"\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260516-001-r5s0.yaml","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep2/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260516-001-r5s0.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep2/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260516-001-r5s0.yaml\n+++ /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/