{"type":"text","timestamp":1778907799633,"sessionID":"ses_1d0d5cb85ffe5rZDnKL7QQils7","part":{"id":"prt_e2f2adf5e001ts9z8y0DvePNoi","messageID":"msg_e2f2a6449001vBheMbxCRAsQGw","sessionID":"ses_1d0d5cb85ffe5rZDnKL7QQils7","type":"text","text":"I found a better micro-opt angle: gate hazard/forward compares with operand-use flags so the pipe stops stalling on rs2 bits that are really immediates. I’m checking that this hasn’t already been tried.","time":{"start":1778907799391,"end":1778907799630},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_040929371561669e016a07fa973aa0819abcb8a1fe7ddeaa81","phase":"commentary"}}}}
