ictor to speculatively choose fall-through vs...","metadata":{"matches":15,"truncated":false},"title":"predictor|BTB|return stack|bimodal|BTFNT|branch","time":{"start":1778929899706,"end":1778929899900}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_038094b7335fbc62016a0850eb7d04819ba98af2b9c8e10110"}},"id":"prt_e307c18a9001RSK1UFgfqVMzLd","sessionID":"ses_1cf840575ffex6HenLtj6HvPlw","messageID":"msg_e307bff79001woxyS6lTLxCd5u"}}
