ation into fetch-time predecode should cut repeated case-tree\\nwork and narrow the control fanout seen by the rest of the pipe.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The hot decode path still rebuilds opcode/funct legality and instruction\\nclass information from the raw 32-bit instruction in ID. Hoisting that\\nclassification into fetch-time predecode should cut repeated case-tree\\nwork and narrow the control fanout seen by the rest of the pipe.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add compact one-hot instruction-class metadata to the IF-stage predecode\\nbundle, then have ID consume those cached classes when forming control and\\nhazard inputs instead of repeatedly re-decoding the same opcode/funct\\npatterns from `instr[31:0]`. Keep the decoder's legality rules unchanged,\\nbut make the common control path structurally narrower so EX and MEM see\\nless combinational decode work on every cycle.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the predecode and pipeline bundles with compact one-hot instruction-class metadata.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute and latch the instruction-class metadata once at fetch time.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Consume the predecoded classes when building control signals instead of re-decoding from the full instruction word.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/decoder.sv\", \"description\": \"Keep legality semantics identical while simplifying dispatch around the predecoded instruction class inputs.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the predecode and pipeline bundles with compact one-hot instruction-class metadata.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute and latch the instruction-class metadata once at fetch time.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"