s cycles waiting on repeated control transfers, especially\\nshort loop backedges and recurring direct jumps. A very small predictor that\\nlearns branch direction without general BTB state could hide those bubbles\\nwhile keeping the existing EX redirect path as the architectural source of\\ntruth.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a tiny direct-mapped direction predictor in IF that speculatively chooses\\nbetween fall-through and the already-available control-flow target, while EX\\nresolution remains authoritative for recovery. Keep the state to a few\\nlearned taken/not-taken bits so repeated CoreMark branches can settle quickly\\nwithout the formal and timing cost of a full BTB or return-stack design.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use predictor output to select the speculative next PC before EX resolution, but keep EX redirects as the final authority.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire resolved branch outcome information into the predictor update path without changing RVFI or trap behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a tiny direct-mapped branch-direction table with simple update logic and a conservative fallback to fall-through.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use predictor output to select the speculative next PC before EX resolution, but keep EX redirects as the ...\n  Line 19: {\"id\": \"hyp-20260516-003-r6s2\", \"title\": \"Advisory loop-backedge predictor\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"CoreMark still spends cycles on repeated loop backedges and direct jumps,\\nso the core keeps paying the EX-stage fetch bubble on control transfers\\nthat are cheap to predict statically. A predictor with no training state\\nis the lowest-risk way to hide more of that control-flow latency.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"CoreMark still spends cycles on repeated loop backedges and direct jumps,\\nso the core keeps paying the EX-stage fetch bubble on control transfers\\nthat are cheap to predict statically. A predictor with no training state\\nis the lowest-risk way to hide more of that control-flow latency.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a purely combinational BTFNT-style hint in IF: predict direct JALs\\ntaken and predict conditional branches taken only when the immediate is\\nbackward, while forward branches fall through. Keep EX-stage resolution\\nas the architectural source of truth for redirects and mispredict repair,\\nso the predictor only changes speculative fetch and not RVFI behavior.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a stateless static branch-direction hint in fetch, but leave EX redirects and wrong-path squashing authoritative.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a stateless static branch-direction hint in fetch, but leave EX redirects and wrong-path squashing authoritative.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 294.69, \"delta_pct\": -8.75, \"vs_baseline\": 4.2, \"fmax_mhz\": 125.53, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4259699, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 10478, \"ff\": 1929, \"seeds\": [127.75, 125.53, 122.74], \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-16T06:16:34.091429Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 6, \"lesson...","metadata":{"matches":12,"truncated":false},"title":"predictor|BTFNT|BTB|branch|return stack|call/return","time":{"start":1778912266049,"end":1778912266077}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c8a5de23a586da0016a080c09e610819bad819a3a07415aad"}},"id":"prt_e2f6f073b001jEVYrkjnGbHO3