n\": \"Thread speculative next-PC selection through fetch and fall back to the existing redirect path on mispredicts.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Instantiate and connect the predictor update path using EX-stage resolution signals.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a small direct-mapped BTB with 2-bit counters and update logic for taken branches and jumps.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Thread speculative next-PC selection through fetch and fall back to the existing redirect path on mispredicts.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Instantiate and connect the predictor update path using EX-stage resolution signals.\"}, {\"fi...\n  Line 5: {\"id\": \"hyp-20260515-001-r2s0\", \"title\": \"Resolve branches in ID\", \"category\": \"micro_opt\", \"motivation\": \"Branch-heavy CoreMark spends a lot of time paying the taken-branch\\nbubble created by waiting until EX to know the outcome. Moving the\\ncommon conditional-branch decision into ID should cut one wrong-path\\ncycle while also shortening the EX timing cone.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"Branch-heavy CoreMark spends a lot of time paying the taken-branch\\nbubble created by waiting until EX to know the outcome. Moving the\\ncommon conditional-branch decision into ID should cut one wrong-path\\ncycle while also shortening the EX timing cone.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add local operand forwarding into ID so BEQ/BNE/BLT/BGE/BLTU/BGEU can\\nbe resolved as soon as decode has the operands, using the branch target\\nalready precomputed in ID. Keep EX as the architectural fallback for\\nthe remaining jump/misalign cases, but stop burning a full EX-stage\\nbubble on ordinary taken branches.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\"