rough `pc_next` selection. This is a structural\\ntiming cleanup: it removes another 32-bit add from EX while preserving the\\nexisting control, RVFI, and trap contract.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the ID/EX bundle with a latched pc_plus4 field.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute and store pc_plus4 alongside the decoded instruction metadata.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Reuse the latched pc_plus4 for JAL writeback and sequential next-PC selection.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the ID/EX bundle with a latched pc_plus4 field.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute and store pc_plus4 alongside the decoded instruction metadata.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Reuse the latched pc_plus4 for JAL writeback and sequential next-PC selection.\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 311.83, ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","truncated":true,"loaded":[]},"title":"cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl","time":{"start":1778919276778,"end":1778919276805}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03d56e3a6920f192016a08276c8da88198acdf00834a4c3741"}},"id":"prt_e2fda00e6001fBukJHKBzrdg9R","sessionID":"ses_1d0264583ffe1bCdEqro7y3me0","messageID":"msg_e2fd9dddf0015ooJd2lCt4VhSn"}}
