: \"Advisory BTFNT fetch hint\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"CoreMark still spends a lot of time in tight loops and repeated control\\ntransfers, so the core keeps paying the EX-stage branch bubble on paths\\nthat are easy to predict statically. A predictor with no training state\\nshould be cheap enough for this tiny FPGA core.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"CoreMark still spends a lot of time in tight loops and repeated control\\ntransfers, so the core keeps paying the EX-stage branch bubble on paths\\nthat are easy to predict statically. A predictor with no training state\\nshould be cheap enough for this tiny FPGA core.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Fold a purely combinational BTFNT hint into IF: predict backward\\nconditional branches taken, forward conditional branches not taken, and\\ndirect JALs taken. Keep EX redirect as the architectural source of truth\\nso mispredict recovery stays simple and RVFI/trap behavior is unchanged,\\nbut hide more fetch bubbles on CoreMark's hot loops.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a stateless static branch-direction predictor that chooses the speculative next PC while still yielding to EX-stage redirects.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a stateless static branch-direction predictor that chooses the speculative next PC while still yielding to EX-stage redirects.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: insn_beq_ch0\\nsummary: counterexample trace: insn_blt_ch0/engine_0/trace.vcd\\nSBY  0:18:39 [insn_blt_ch0] summary:   failed assertion rvfi_testbench._witness_.check_flatten_checker_inst__assert_rvfi_insn_check_sv_178_115 at rvfi_insn_check.sv:178.7-178.76 step 20\\nSBY  0:18:39 [insn_blt_ch0] DONE (FA