ect remain\\nthe source of truth for recovery so the predictor stays narrow and\\nCoreMark-focused.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use the loop predictor to choose the speculative next PC for exact-hit backward branches while preserving EX-stage redirect priority.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire retired branch PC, target, and taken/not-taken outcome into the predictor update path without changing RVFI behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a one-entry loop-count predictor with exact-PC tagging, cached target, and conservative fall-through on miss.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\"... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n38: {\"id\": \"hyp-20260517-001-r13s0\", \"title\": \"Source-read compare gating\", \"category\": \"micro_opt\", \"motivation\": \"The load-use interlock still compares both source fields on every instruction,\\neven when the opcode never reads rs2. That burns always-on compare fanout and\\ncan inject false bubbles on common immediate-style CoreMark instructions.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The load-use interlock still compares both source fields on every instruction,\\neven when the opcode never reads rs2. That burns always-on compare fanout and\\ncan inject false bubbles on common immediate-style CoreMark instructions.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add exact `uses_rs1` and `uses_rs2` masks to the fetch-time predecode bundle,\\nderive them from the already-validated opcode class, and use them to gate the\\nload-use compare tree in `hazard_unit.sv`. Keep illegal or ambiguous cases\\npessimistic so the interlock only disappears when a source operand is definitely\\nunused.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\