h bubbles without changing the architectural redirect contract.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a single-entry loop-count predictor that remembers the most recent\\nretired backward conditional branch PC, its target, and a small trip-count\\nconfidence counter. Speculate only on exact-PC hits for that loop, train\\nonly from retired branch outcomes, and always let EX-stage redirect remain\\nthe source of truth for recovery so the predictor stays narrow and\\nCoreMark-focused.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use the loop predictor to choose the speculative next PC for exact-hit backward branches while preserving EX-stage redirect priority.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire retired branch PC, target, and taken/not-taken outcome into the predictor update path without changing RVFI behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a one-entry loop-count predictor with exact-PC tagging, cached target, and conservative fall-through on miss.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\"... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl","time":{"start":1778990646559,"end":1778990646563}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0e84435d3bfb4802016a093e3637c48197b84a69a1866e4c40"}},"id":"prt_e341b046f0010AXvOR0oON7yFu","sessionID":"ses_1cbe55b85ffeSfXCysNCLpVqZc","messageID":"msg_e341af555001n6iFTwIMWCXBIG"}}
